      "everyaction+DTO+permission+presence+version/receipt+SHA recorded; proposals notpresented asimplementedAPI"
    ],
    "W7-BIZ-037": [
      "all28 applicable actiongroups or individual source-basedN/A; three writes notdone",
      "single publicMutation/Draft/REC/Export/Print/UI entries, no page-owned duplicate",
      "Dart/WPF/server samecases + realWin7 x86/x64 interactions + Win10 defaultregression",
      "close version/receipt/durablegaps or explicit recorded scope decision; do notsilently lowerDoD"
